02:21:21,550 --> 02:21:25,070
Find a technique, tell us, from your experience, find a guide.

2253
02:21:25,150 --> 02:21:27,670
If we find it, we will also find peace.

2254
02:21:27,750 --> 02:21:30,230
Emotional letter done, but hope you understand.

2255
02:21:30,310 --> 02:21:37,230
Thanks in advance, brother. Really looking forward to your advice. Your fan, Jagga.

2256
02:21:37,310 --> 02:21:39,230
What's up, Jagga ji? Great.

2257
02:21:39,310 --> 02:21:44,115
So, as you heard about Jagga ji, he has been in Canada for 18 years.

2258
02:21:44,195 --> 02:21:46,802
And his fiancé is a registered nurse.

2259
02:21:46,882 --> 02:21:52,644
He wants to start a fast food chain because obviously people are coming to Canada,

2260
02:21:52,724 --> 02:21:55,456
so things are going towards development.

2261
02:21:55,536 --> 02:21:58,120
And his family has four children.

2262
02:21:58,200 --> 02:22:00,120
We have made a wedding for 400 people.

2263
02:22:00,200 --> 02:22:03,400
One crore INR is being spent, which is a lot man.

2264
02:22:03,480 --> 02:22:06,280
Even in Pakistani terms, a wedding worth one crore is a big wedding.

2265
02:22:06,360 --> 02:22:10,200
So straight up, it's four and a half crores according to Pakistani.

2266
02:22:10,280 --> 02:22:12,000
So that's a lot man.

2267
02:22:12,080 --> 02:22:18,080
With that money you can start, I mean, you can open two restaurants there in Canada, if I'm not wrong.

2268
02:22:18,160 --> 02:22:20,080
How many thousand dollars?

2269
02:22:20,160 --> 02:22:24,280
One hundred thousand dollars is USD.

2270
02:22:24,360 --> 02:22:25,570
So one hundred thousand dollars is a big amount.

2271
02:22:25,650 --> 02:22:27,570
You can do a lot with this.

2272
02:22:27,650 --> 02:22:28,410
You asked me, honestly speaking, I didn't like these big functions from the beginning.

2273
02:22:28,490 --> 02:22:35,570
my wife or.

2274
02:22:35,650 --> 02:22:39,570
And I was really against the idea of feeding 500 people that I don't even meet.

2275
02:22:39,650 --> 02:22:43,570
And they only meet at weddings or funerals.

2276
02:22:43,650 --> 02:22:46,570
So I was not a fan of the idea.

2277
02:22:46,650 --> 02:22:50,650
Plus I didn't have enough money. I only had enough money. I bought a beautiful ring for my wife.

2278
02:22:54,000 --> 02:22:57,280
We flew to Turkey and we just did it among our friends.

2279
02:22:57,360 --> 02:23:01,880
And my parents, yeah my parents, they never bothered me in my life.

2280
02:23:01,960 --> 02:23:05,640
I think a lot of my success has to do with the fact that

2281
02:23:05,720 --> 02:23:08,240
I didn't have any problem from my parents side.

2282
02:23:08,320 --> 02:23:11,280
There was no tension, there was no force.

2283
02:23:11,360 --> 02:23:13,880
They believed in me a lot.

2284
02:23:13,960 --> 02:23:17,040
And I have, Alhamdulillah, proven, I hope so.

2285
02:23:17,120 --> 02:23:20,820
They saw when I was sixteen, fifteen years old.

2286
02:23:20,900 --> 02:23:22,820
I used to teach at a young age.

2287
02:23:22,900 --> 02:23:24,820
And then I got into work, then I worked in a restaurant.

2288
02:23:24,900 --> 02:23:26,820
So they understood that he is responsible.

2289
02:23:26,900 --> 02:23:28,820
We just have to support him.

2290
02:23:28,900 --> 02:23:30,820
Don't annoy him.

2291
02:23:30,900 --> 02:23:36,820
So I was very peaceful from my household to this day, Alhamdulillah.

2292
02:23:36,900 --> 02:23:38,820
The family doesn't bother.

2293
02:23:38,900 --> 02:23:40,820
So they were happy.

2294
02:23:40,900 --> 02:23:44,820
I told my mom that this is the situation and I am doing it.

2295
02:23:44,900 --> 02:23:46,370
Okay, tell me when it happens.

2296
02:23:46,450 --> 02:23:49,170
We'll distribute sweets here." She was that chill.

2297
02:23:49,250 --> 02:23:55,330
Although every parent wants their children to get married in a grand manner, especially when it comes to sons.

2298
02:23:55,410 --> 02:24:01,970
So obviously there is a desire because it's like sort of, our parents get a little happiness in life.

2299
02:24:02,050 --> 02:24:05,410
Especially mothers who have already suffered so much.

2300
02:24:05,490 --> 02:24:11,490
So one day she becomes a celebrity. She's like the apple of the eye of the whole family. Well not really, but you get what I'm saying.

2301
02:24:13,350 --> 02:24:17,110
Everyone comes and meets you with love, right? So that is something.

2302
02:24:17,190 --> 02:24:20,997
You think about it, you have a child, you raise him, you marry him,

2303
02:24:21,077 --> 02:24:24,910
so that's sort of like a celebration that yes, I have made him an adult.

2304
02:24:24,990 --> 02:24:27,790
So the point of view of parents is that I have made him an adult.

2305
02:24:27,870 --> 02:24:34,270
And then in our local setup, there is also that we have to one-up.

2306
02:24:34,350 --> 02:24:37,030
If someone has such a big wedding, we have to make it even bigger.

2307
02:24:37,110 --> 02:24:39,100
Eat more and waste less.

2308
02:24:39,180 --> 02:24:42,340
If you don't have enough, you always have to order more.

2309
02:24:42,420 --> 02:24:45,540
People from RSVP don't know what RSVP means.

2310
02:24:45,620 --> 02:24:49,060
It's to manage the amount of food and drinks.

2311
02:24:49,140 --> 02:24:52,620
When the confirmation number comes, I want 500 people to come.

2312
02:24:52,700 --> 02:24:56,620
But out of those 500, 250 are saying that only we can come, the rest are saying 250, we can't come.

2313
02:24:56,700 --> 02:24:58,420
So now I know the figure is 250.

2314
02:24:58,500 --> 02:25:01,300
So I got food for 270 people, right?

2315
02:25:01,380 --> 02:25:02,820
Plus minus 20. It happens.

2316
02:25:02,900 --> 02:25:04,900
You don't know how many are coming here.

2317
02:25:05,460 --> 02:25:08,180
Two people, six people are coming from there.

2318
02:25:08,260 --> 02:25:09,180
Okay?

2319
02:25:09,260 --> 02:25:10,180
So you don't know.

2320
02:25:10,260 --> 02:25:16,580
So if you have given a card to 100 people hoping that 300 people will come, then the food is made for 600 people.

2321
02:25:16,660 --> 02:25:18,580
It's such a waste.

2322
02:25:18,660 --> 02:25:22,180
Anyway, so that one-up also happens and then there are many factors.

2323
02:25:22,260 --> 02:25:26,780
So then parents don't want to give up this dream.

2324
02:25:26,860 --> 02:25:32,768
Anyway, in our case, there were other kids, so they said, okay, this one is not coming, so it doesn't matter.

2325
02:25:32,848 --> 02:25:35,768
We will do our hobbies in other weddings, which they did.

2326
02:25:35,848 --> 02:25:38,768
So that was also an advantage for me.

2327
02:25:38,848 --> 02:25:40,768
So I didn't have any problem as such.

2328
02:25:40,848 --> 02:25:43,768
And we saved a lot of money, man.

2329
02:25:43,848 --> 02:25:45,768
With that money, we traveled openly for the next four years.

2330
02:25:45,848 --> 02:25:46,768
Did it by pressing.

2331
02:25:46,848 --> 02:25:49,768
Like after the wedding, my traveling was very open.

2332
02:25:49,848 --> 02:25:52,768
So we had a great time.

2333
02:25:52,848 --> 02:25:54,768
We made wonderful memories.

2334
02:25:54,848 --> 02:25:55,768
What are the memories of that wedding?

2335
02:25:55,848 --> 02:25:59,848
I mean, like on the wedding day, the groom and bride are the most exhausted.

2336
02:26:00,320 --> 02:26:03,920
The bride leaves at 2 pm to get ready.

2337
02:26:04,000 --> 02:26:08,520
She gets ready at 6 or 7 pm and then she is obviously a doll of a mother.

2338
02:26:08,600 --> 02:26:12,280
She might sweat a lot because obviously the makeup will be ruined.

2339
02:26:12,360 --> 02:26:17,960
So she is in such a big lehenga, from here to there, from here to there. They get really, really exhausted.

2340
02:26:18,040 --> 02:26:20,560
And of course, the groom has a hundred tensions on his head.

2341
02:26:20,640 --> 02:26:22,560
Because he has to do everything.

2342
02:26:22,640 --> 02:26:24,000
More or less.

2343
02:26:24,080 --> 02:26:26,480
And obviously, it's his function.

2344
02:26:26,560 --> 02:26:27,640
There is tension and pressure.

2345
02:26:27,720 --> 02:26:30,640
So they come home and sleep after getting tired.

2346
02:26:30,720 --> 02:26:35,640
So I heard that we slept after coming home that we will do whatever we have to do later.

2347
02:26:35,720 --> 02:26:39,640
So yeah man, it becomes a chore.

2348
02:26:39,720 --> 02:26:43,640
I mean it should be your day man. It should be where you relax.

2349
02:26:43,720 --> 02:26:45,640
Come on, not a hundred percent relaxed.

2350
02:26:45,720 --> 02:26:53,640
But understand that you are not so much pressure that my legs do not come to the ground.

2351
02:26:53,720 --> 02:26:54,510
I mean, there is no such pressure.

2352
02:26:54,590 --> 02:27:00,510
Marriage is supposed to be fun, not a pain in the ass.

2353
02:27:00,590 --> 02:27:05,510
So, it's true that 1 crore is too much.

2354
02:27:05,590 --> 02:27:11,510
And if we lower the list to 100, by the end of the day they'll take it to 300.

2355
02:27:11,590 --> 02:27:13,510
Because everybody's important.

2356
02:27:13,590 --> 02:27:18,510
I know when my mother was sitting down and making lists for my sister's wedding,

2357
02:27:18,590 --> 02:27:21,480
she was the one who had to be called.

2358
02:27:21,560 --> 02:27:23,880
They came too, they called us on that too.

2359
02:27:23,960 --> 02:27:28,040
Then it also depends on how much they gave or how much we gave them.

2360
02:27:28,120 --> 02:27:30,400
So we have to balance that too.

2361
02:27:30,480 --> 02:27:34,640
So, I don't know man.

2362
02:27:34,720 --> 02:27:37,280
If you go for a hundred, it will be three hundred.

2363
02:27:37,360 --> 02:27:41,760
Will you allow? I don't know. You didn't tell me how many siblings you have.

2364
02:27:41,840 --> 02:27:44,480
Have these hobbies of theirs been fulfilled or not?

2365
02:27:44,560 --> 02:27:46,720
Big fat wedding ones.

2366
02:27:46,800 --> 02:27:48,050
Like I said.

2367
02:27:48,130 --> 02:27:51,210
I said in my case, I said, let's do it somewhere else.

2368
02:27:51,290 --> 02:27:54,610
So they did it in the wedding of the rest of the brothers and sisters.

2369
02:27:54,690 --> 02:27:56,250
So do you have that leverage?

2370
02:27:56,330 --> 02:27:59,730
Because at the end of the day, parents have only one happy day.

2371
02:27:59,810 --> 02:28:03,850
They have a very difficult life.

2372
02:28:03,930 --> 02:28:07,010
What is the middle class, what is the lower middle class?

2373
02:28:07,090 --> 02:28:09,290
I think the lives of Desi people are already difficult.

2374
02:28:09,370 --> 02:28:14,210
Culturally, socially, there is so much pressure that it's not about haves or have-nots.

2375
02:28:14,530 --> 02:28:21,370
about the fact that you're a desi, you're surrounded by so much pressure and so many eyes poking into your lives.

2376
02:28:21,450 --> 02:28:28,050
So that's a day for them. So I won't say that you should take that day or that happiness from them.

2377
02:28:28,130 --> 02:28:32,650
However, at the same time, I would also not want you to break your back, go in debt.

2378
02:28:32,730 --> 02:28:35,210
And you have to start a new life.

2379
02:28:35,290 --> 02:28:41,130
Look, I think in Sikh culture, the culture of Sagan.

2380
02:28:41,710 --> 02:28:45,630
We call it Sagnan, where they give money.

2381
02:28:45,710 --> 02:28:51,630
So it's not the repayment of food that we ate a buffet and this is the money.

2382
02:28:51,710 --> 02:28:54,630
That is for you to start your new life.

2383
02:28:54,710 --> 02:28:58,630
This is to start a new life. Right?

2384
02:28:58,710 --> 02:29:01,600
We have made it the opposite. So.

2385
02:29:03,310 --> 02:29:06,350
Yeah man, I will always choose you to save money because

2386
02:29:06,430 --> 02:29:10,690
what's the point of starting such a life if you keep paying debt for the first 5 years?

2387
02:29:10,770 --> 02:29:13,150
I know somebody who's very very close to me.

2388
02:29:13,230 --> 02:29:16,590
He was paying the credit card for the next 7 years of his marriage.

2389
02:29:16,670 --> 02:29:22,950
So I said, when will you start your life? When will you buy a house? When will you buy a car? When will you pay your loan?

2390
02:29:23,030 --> 02:29:25,510
I mean, till mid-thirties, you're in debt.

2391
02:29:25,590 --> 02:29:29,600
Oh man, you have to live a debt-free life. Remember this. I made this mistake too.

2392
02:29:29,680 --> 02:29:31,412
I had nowhere else to go man.

2393
02:29:31,492 --> 02:29:33,179
I had to take credit cards.

2394
02:29:33,259 --> 02:29:35,946
I got stuck in that loop really really bad.

2395
02:29:36,026 --> 02:29:38,400
I got out of it, never made one again.

2396
02:29:38,480 --> 02:29:44,400
Today the bank is running after me, saying take this, take that, take platinum, take this service. I don't want it. I don't want it.

2397
02:29:44,480 --> 02:29:46,993
So, we have to live a debt free life.

2398
02:29:47,073 --> 02:29:48,791
Debt is like the worst thing.

2399
02:29:48,871 --> 02:29:50,293
It will break your back.

2400
02:29:50,373 --> 02:29:55,135
And where interest as a Muslim, I believe that where interest will be involved,

2401
02:29:55,215 --> 02:29:56,480
you will be in debt.

2402
02:29:56,910 --> 02:29:58,830
Your money will not be blessed.

2403
02:29:58,910 --> 02:30:05,830
In 2005, there were months, so my nature of work was, the more work, the more money.

2404
02:30:05,910 --> 02:30:10,830
So I used to work for 18 hours, there were months I was making 90,000 rupees.

2405
02:30:10,910 --> 02:30:15,880
90,000 rupees. I'm talking in 2005. Okay?

2406
02:30:15,960 --> 02:30:21,589
At that time, the grocery in our house used to come in maximum 6,000 rupees.

2407
02:30:21,669 --> 02:30:22,123
Maximum.

2408
02:30:22,203 --> 02:30:22,537
Okay?

2409
02:30:22,617 --> 02:30:23,820
It's 20 years old.

2410
02:30:24,480 --> 02:30:28,400
I didn't know where that money was going.

2411
02:30:28,480 --> 02:30:31,400
I was giving it to the banks and then I saw the principal standing there.

2412
02:30:31,480 --> 02:30:34,400
The principal wasn't moving because I was making minimum payments.

2413
02:30:34,480 --> 02:30:37,400
There were three cards. Then to finish those three cards, I took a big loan.

2414
02:30:37,480 --> 02:30:40,400
I killed all three of them with a big loan. Now there is a big loan and I am.

2415
02:30:40,480 --> 02:30:46,400
Oh, what a stupid life. These hair were lost in the twenties. It was so stressful.

2416
02:30:46,480 --> 02:30:48,400
So never go into debt in life.

2417
02:30:48,480 --> 02:30:51,730
I will tell everyone that what is the benefit of such marriages?

2418
02:30:51,810 --> 02:30:53,170
that in the next 10 years you'll get married.

2419
02:30:53,250 --> 02:30:55,170
And there's no guarantee of that marriage.

2420
02:30:55,250 --> 02:30:57,170
Brother, I didn't understand, you didn't get married.

2421
02:30:57,250 --> 02:31:01,170
Now you're in debt for the next 10 years because you made a wrong choice in your life.

2422
02:31:01,250 --> 02:31:03,170
Then what? Right?

2423
02:31:03,250 --> 02:31:06,570
If the choice is right or wrong, then okay, you bear the pain.

2424
02:31:06,650 --> 02:31:10,570
One is that you went into debt, the choice is also bad.

2425
02:31:10,650 --> 02:31:13,570
I mean, the spouse is also not fun.

2426
02:31:13,650 --> 02:31:17,570
I mean, there are ten thousand problems or you know, the way you listen, problems keep coming.

2427
02:31:17,650 --> 02:31:19,530
I liked my cousin's red dress.

2428
02:31:19,610 --> 02:31:21,170
or you have spent crores of rupees.

2429
02:31:21,250 --> 02:31:23,330
There he is saying, cousin came in a red dress.

2430
02:31:23,410 --> 02:31:25,490
Show me the Kajrara. Right?

2431
02:31:25,570 --> 02:31:29,970
So I will never ever suggest you save money.

2432
02:31:30,050 --> 02:31:31,010
Find a middle ground.

2433
02:31:31,090 --> 02:31:33,770
Give them their happiness and you too get out of debt.

2434
02:31:33,850 --> 02:31:34,890
This is my advice.

2435
02:31:34,970 --> 02:31:38,530
There was a time when I was very rebellious, so my advice was rebellious.

2436
02:31:38,610 --> 02:31:42,210
But as I am growing, I am also understanding because now I am a parent.

2437
02:31:42,290 --> 02:31:45,730
So I am now understanding the point of view of a parent in life a little bit.

2438
02:31:45,810 --> 02:31:47,520
So I understand. Give them a little happiness.

2439
02:31:47,600 --> 02:31:48,713
They want happiness.

2440
02:31:48,793 --> 02:31:50,902
They have a day, Andy Warhol says,

2441
02:31:50,982 --> 02:31:54,820
that everybody will be famous for 15 minutes in their lifetime.

2442
02:31:54,900 --> 02:31:59,320
So I think our parents' 15 minutes of fame is the children's wedding.

2443
02:31:59,400 --> 02:32:05,820
In which all the children, Sharma ji's son and Ritu ji's daughter, all are present.

2444
02:32:05,900 --> 02:32:10,320
And you know, the comparison is great.

2445
02:32:10,400 --> 02:32:14,140
And there is a little flexing that, look, I am a successful mother.

2446
02:32:14,220 --> 02:32:20,140
My son is educated, he has a restaurant in Canada, and now he's getting married.

2447
02:32:20,220 --> 02:32:22,140
He's this big. Right?

2448
02:32:22,220 --> 02:32:27,140
So they live for this day. What else can they do? They have no happiness in their lives.

2449
02:32:27,220 --> 02:32:33,140
It's a plus one. So because of that plus one, don't break your back. Whoever is listening.

2450
02:32:33,220 --> 02:32:34,540
Don't go into debt.

2451
02:32:34,620 --> 02:32:36,138
And if you are in debt,

2452
02:32:36,218 --> 02:32:41,770
then bring your lifestyle down completely and get rid of the debt first.

2453
02:32:41,850 --> 02:32:45,370
Debt should be your enemy number one right now.

2454
02:32:45,450 --> 02:32:46,450
Okay?

2455
02:32:46,610 --> 02:32:50,850
I understand. To start a new life. And then of course in Western countries,

2456
02:32:50,930 --> 02:32:54,010
the design is such that you are always in debt.

2457
02:32:54,090 --> 02:32:57,290
Whether it's your mortgage, or your car, etc.

2458
02:32:57,530 --> 02:32:59,570
Okay? Those things are also important. But,

2459
02:32:59,810 --> 02:33:02,090
don't spread your legs more than the sheet.

2460
02:33:02,330 --> 02:33:06,810
Try to make the sheet bigger, but as the sheet gets bigger, it's not like your legs are getting bigger.

2461
02:33:06,890 --> 02:33:08,500
So you are standing on the same breakeven.

2462
02:33:08,580 --> 02:33:10,500
Keep your legs inside.

2463
02:33:10,580 --> 02:33:12,500
Try to spread the blanket.

2464
02:33:12,580 --> 02:33:15,500
And get out of debt first.

2465
02:33:15,580 --> 02:33:17,500
Debt eats your youth.

2466
02:33:17,580 --> 02:33:22,500
Then when it comes to enjoying your life and when money comes, then there is no strength.

2467
02:33:22,580 --> 02:33:24,500
Then you have ten thousand problems.

2468
02:33:24,580 --> 02:33:27,500
Then you can't openly move around.

2469
02:33:27,580 --> 02:33:31,095
You know, there are so many things I want to do,

2470
02:33:31,175 --> 02:33:36,360
but then I have so many other people to look out for and not come across.

2471
02:33:36,440 --> 02:33:39,360
across as someone who's selfish.

2472
02:33:39,440 --> 02:33:43,860
You know, Visa is there, my friends are in Budapest, calling me, come.

2473
02:33:43,940 --> 02:33:45,160
Can't go, man.

2474
02:33:45,240 --> 02:33:49,360
But this thing, 10-15 years ago, we would have caught a plane and left.

2475
02:33:49,440 --> 02:33:55,940
But that time, we made the wrong decisions or we made the wrong decisions or we made the wrong decisions.

2476
02:33:56,040 --> 02:34:00,223
Anyway, everything comes at the right time, but at the same time,

2477
02:34:00,303 --> 02:34:03,570
try to get yourself out of unnecessary debt.

2478
02:34:03,650 --> 02:34:05,170
